, "name": "洗衣機"}, {"key": "tv", "active": 1, "name": "電視"}, {"key": "cold", "active": 1, "name": "冷氣"}, {"key": "heater", "active": 1, "name": "熱水器"}, {"key": "bed", "active": 1, "name": "床"}, {"key": "closet", "active": 1, "name": "衣櫃"}, {"key": "fourth", "active": 1, "name": "第四台"}, {"key": "net", "active": 1, "name": "網路"}, {"key": "gas", "active": 0, "name": "天然瓦斯"}, {"key": "sofa", "active": 0, "name": "沙發"}, {"key": "table_chairs", "active": 1, "name": "桌椅"}, {"key": "balcony", "active": 0, "name": "陽台"}, {"key": "lift", "active": 0, "name": "電梯"}, {"key": "park", "active": 0, "name": "車位"}], "notice": [{"key": "leaseTime", "name": "最短一年"}, {"key": "pet", "name": "不可養寵物"}]}, "preference": {"title": "優選理由", "active": 1, "footnote": "還有1個選擇本房的理由", "data": [{"id": 1, "name": "產權有保障", "text": "已在地政局辦理建物產權登記，選擇更安心", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_01.png"}, {"id": 3, "name": "拎包入住", "text": "滿足90%的日常所需設備，享輕鬆入住體驗", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_03.png"}, {"id": 5, "name": "出行超便利", "text": "距雙連捷運站 131公尺，通勤/購物都方便", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_05.png"}, {"id": 6, "name": "租金低", "text": "比同社區同格局的房屋，租金低約7071元", "icon": "https://s.591.com.tw/build/static/app/rent/perfer_06.png"}]}, "remark": {"title": "屋況介紹", "key": "remark", "active": 1, "content": "<p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 2, 7);\"><strong>禁寵!室內禁菸!</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 2, 7);\"><strong>禁寵!室內禁菸!禁寵!室內禁菸!</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\">現在預約看屋後，簽約以後只需換洗衣物即可直接入住！！<br><br>鄰近雙連捷運站商圈，寧夏夜市，新光衣蝶商圈，馬偕醫院等樓下就有7~11，生活機能超方便，購物飲食免煩惱！！<br><br>交通便利，近公車站、捷運站（2號出口）走路只要2分鐘！！<br><br>自已浴廁有獨立洗衣機，環境乾淨，高級衛浴設備，乾溼分離浴廁~<br><br>樓層大門使用磁卡機門禁鎖，保障居住安全更加分~<br><br>公用大露台，讓您曬衣、曬棉被都超方便~獨立筒床墊，睡眠更有品質;&nbsp;<br><br>儲熱式電熱水器，使用更安全~<br><br>為維護大家的居住、睡眠品質及環境清潔，禁止飼養寵物唷，請見諒！！<br><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>相關費用</strong></span><strong><br><br></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>1、水費每月150元</strong></span><strong><br><br></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>2、電費有獨立電表，依台電平均電價計算</strong></span><strong><br><br></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>3、第四台每月250元</strong></span><strong><br><br></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><strong>4、垃圾須自行處理等待垃圾車</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">【入住條件】</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">1、性別友善，適合單身貴族、上班族、學生、夫妻情侶</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">2、穩定正當工作、品行優良好溝通相處</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">3、年滿18歲以上，限本國國籍者</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">【寵物條件】</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">禁養寵物!禁養寵物!禁養寵物!</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">【備註條件】</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">※為維護居住生活品質，以下行業及行為恕無法承租（正職、兼職均不可）</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">1、直播主、八大行業</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">2、特殊性行業（殯葬業、檳榔業）</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">3、色情行業</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">4、生活作息不良者</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">5、拖延、遲繳租金</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">6、賭博、聚眾喧嘩吵鬧、從事非法項目</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">7、邋遢、製造髒亂、交友圈複雜</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">8、酗酒、抽煙、吃檳榔、吸毒嗑藥</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">（若發現違法行為一律報警並以違約論處置）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">【聯絡時間】</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">週一至週日：上午10點至晚上9點</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">【聯絡方式】</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">電話：0927908003（代理人顏先生）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">#有任何問題請來電或加Line詢問</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">#請勿在線上直接預約及詢問</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 13.33px;\">#誠意出租無誠勿擾</span><br>附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百